Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.95,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:08.79,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Inu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:12.10,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Izumi's out sick today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:24.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\an8\pos(278.667,14)\3c&H455D40&}Goals for the Week
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:24.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\an8\3c&H455D40&\pos(455.334,12.667)}This Month's Events
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:15.51,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Jeez, not so loud. How do you \Nhave so much energy this early?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:17.04,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Also, don't drop the "zuka."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:21.09,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear that from a guy who \Nrolls up his sleeves when it's this cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:23.60,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi messaged me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.38,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\frz-8\fs12\c&H46453A&\3c&HF1F1E6&\shad0\pos(261.334,48)}Sorry! Could you take notes for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.38,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnArial\frz-8\fs12\c&H46453A&\3c&HD4F5C1&\shad0\pos(478.668,229.999)}Ok
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:26.38,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\frz-8\fs12\c&H46453A&\3c&HF1F1E6&\shad0\pos(229.334,281.333)}Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.38,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,He asked me to take notes for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.86,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, so you already knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.63,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I feel so left out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.29,0:00:33.54,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh... Notes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:36.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:42.90,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,For some reason, my friend's \Ngirlfriend sees me as a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.86,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(1780,1)\an8\fs30\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H907F7D&\3c&HEEEDEB&}Shikimori's {\c&H696767&}Not {\c&H989595&}Just {\c&H92767E&}a {\c&H928B8B&}Cutie
